      "@type": "mira:Evidence",
      "schema:name": "dat-nanoclustering-slows-clearance",
      "schema:description": "Dense DAT nanoclusters (20 nm diameter) take approximately 400 ms to clear a 100 nM DA bolus compared to approximately 200 ms for unclustered DAT, because local [DA] at the cluster surface drops near zero creating a diffusion-limited bottleneck.",
